Package: nekohub
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: nekoHub contributors
Depends: openssh-client
Homepage: https://github.com/awakyy1/nekohub
Description: Linux fleet management designed for the terminal
 nekoHub is an agentless terminal interface for monitoring the local machine
 or remote Linux hosts through an existing OpenSSH configuration.
